  (text "12V logic input (steady <= 15 V; TVS is for spikes) -> fuse -> SMAJ24CA bidirectional TVS -> P-FET reverse protection (same as the HAT)\n-> LM5164 buck, 3.3V 1A, 300 kHz, Type-3 ripple injection (datasheet SNVSAU4D 7.2.2).\nVOUT = 1.2 x (1 + 174k/100k) = 3.29 V.  RON = 3.3 x 2500 / 300 kHz = 27.4k.\nEN/UVLO: start 1.5 x (1 + 301k/100k) = 6.0 V, stop 5.6 V.\nL1: FNR6045S220MT 22uH, 2.2 A (LM5164 peak limit 1.75 A max), 116 mR, 6x6 shielded.\nRipple 0.46 A p-p at 40 V in.  Type 3: CA >= 525 pF -> 3.3 nF, RA 124k -> 16 mV (8 V) .. 25 mV (40 V) at FB.\nVSENSE_12V: 100k/10k divider (12 V -> 1.09 V), BAT54S clamp to the rails."
    (at 20 15 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "fdfb7996-cf98-5fad-8e10-3f2469c9f59b")))
